WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.612 line:78%
Welcome back, Architect. Awareness alone doesn't change a life. A decision does.

00:00:05.662 --> 00:00:11.007 line:78%
There comes a moment when every meaningful transformation asks something of us.

00:00:11.057 --> 00:00:16.131 line:78%
Not another idea. Not another plan. A decision. A decision to stop waiting.

00:00:16.181 --> 00:00:21.458 line:78%
A decision to stop allowing fear, comfort, or expectation to shape our future.

00:00:21.508 --> 00:00:23.808 line:78%
This chapter is about that moment.

00:00:23.858 --> 00:00:28.594 line:78%
The moment you decide that your Back Half will not happen by accident.

00:00:28.644 --> 00:00:33.921 line:78%
It will happen because you choose it. Take your time with the exercises ahead.

00:00:33.971 --> 00:00:37.556 line:78%
Don't rush this chapter. Some decisions change a day.

00:00:37.606 --> 00:00:40.177 line:78%
Others change the direction of a life.

00:00:40.227 --> 00:00:45.301 line:78%
I believe you're about to make one of those decisions. When you're ready...

00:00:45.351 --> 00:00:46.610 line:78%
Let's begin Chapter Three.
